        <p class="dj-hero-proof">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ &nbsp;<strong>4.9/5</strong> · Trusted by 500+ jewelry businesses</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Dashboard mock -->
      <div class="dj-hero-card">
