          </div>
          <h3 class="dj-card-title">Manufacturing Delays</h3>
          <p class="dj-card-desc">Lack of production tracking creates job work delays and missed delivery commitments to customers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dj-ch-card">
          <div class="dj-icon-box">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b55d9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="dj-card-title">Stock Mismatch</h3>
          <p class="dj-card-desc">Disconnected systems mean physical stock never matches system records, hurting business decisions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dj-ch-card">
          <div class="dj-icon-box">
