          <h3 class="dj-card-title">Secure Backup</h3>
          <p class="dj-card-desc">Military-grade encryption with automated daily backups and full disaster recovery protection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dj-feat-card">
          <div class="dj-icon-box"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b55d9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg></div>
