          <p class="dj-card-desc">Granular permissions ensure staff only see and modify what they are authorized to access.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dj-feat-card">
          <div class="dj-icon-box"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b55d9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div>
